.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt PROTECT 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm protect
.Nd change mapping protection
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft int
.Fn protect "Handle proc" "usize addr" "usize len" "usize prot"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call changes the protection of a mapped range in .Fa proc.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
